  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HMA Laos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will reduce the threat from unexploded ordnance in Khammouane Province through clearance linked to community development priorities. It will improve safe access to farmland, livelihoods, schools, and local infrastructure for affected communities, with particular attention to vulnerable groups and remote ethnic communities, while supporting national and local authorities in implementing Laos&#x2019; mine action and development plans.</narrative>
  </description>
